1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/kcp","children":["KCP 源码分析与原理总结"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/kcp.jpg","alt":"KCP 源码分析与原理总结 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"计算机基础"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"KCP 源码分析与原理总结"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本文详细介绍了游戏开发中常用的网络协议 KCP 的底层原理和源码实现。通过大量图示和原理总结,帮助读者深入理解 KCP 协议的工作机制，包括其快速重传、选择性确认、流量控制等核心特性。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2024-12-01T10:08:02.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2024/12/01"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","14,451"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"序言","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#序言","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#序言"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"序言","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":4,"offset":3},"end":{"line":1,"column":6,"offset":5}}}]},"children":"序言"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本文很大部分参考了 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://luyuhuang.tech/2020/12/09/kcp.html","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://luyuhuang.tech/2020/12/09/kcp.html"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"详解 KCP 协议的原理和实现","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":12,"offset":18},"end":{"line":3,"column":27,"offset":33}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":11,"offset":17},"end":{"line":3,"column":72,"offset":78}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"详解 KCP 协议的原理和实现"}],"，非常感谢该文作者的讲解。本文再此基础上，加入了一些笔者的思考和分析图示，以期更好地理解 KCP 的底层原理。"]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"结论先行","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#结论先行","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#结论先行"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"结论先行","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":4,"offset":138},"end":{"line":5,"column":8,"offset":142}}}]},"children":"结论先行"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"KCP 是一个快速可靠协议，能以比 TCP 浪费 10%-20% 的带宽的代价，换取平均延迟降低 30%-40%，且最大延迟降低三倍的传输效果。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"TCP 是为流量设计的（每秒内可以传输多少 KB 的数据），讲究的是充分利用带宽。而 KCP 是为流速设计的（单个数据包从一端发送到一端需要多少时间），以 10%-20% 带宽浪费的代价换取了比 TCP 快 30%-40% 的传输速度。TCP 信道是一条流速很慢，但每秒流量很大的大运河，而 KCP 是水流湍急的小激流。"}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"kcp-增加的带宽在哪里增加的速度又在哪里","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#kcp-增加的带宽在哪里增加的速度又在哪里","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#kcp-增加的带宽在哪里增加的速度又在哪里"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"KCP 增加的带宽在哪里？增加的速度又在哪里？","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":5,"offset":384},"end":{"line":11,"column":28,"offset":407}}}]},"children":"KCP 增加的带宽在哪里？增加的速度又在哪里？"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20240612111337839.png","alt":"为什么 KCP 能以比 TCP 浪费 10%-20% 的带宽的代价，换取平均延迟降低 30%-40%？","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20240612111337839.png","alt":"为什么 KCP 能以比 TCP 浪费 10%-20% 的带宽的代价，换取平均延迟降低 30%-40%？"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1,"offset":409},"end":{"line":13,"column":135,"offset":543}}}}]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"kcp-核心特性","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#kcp-核心特性","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#kcp-核心特性"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"KCP 核心特性","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":5,"offset":549},"end":{"line":15,"column":13,"offset":557}}}]},"children":"KCP 核心特性"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"快速重传"}],"： KCP 支持快速重传机制，不像 TCP 那样依赖超时重传。KCP 可以根据接收方返回的确认信息快速判断哪些数据包已经丢失，并迅速进行重传。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"选择性确认（Selective Acknowledgment, SACK）"}],"： KCP 支持 SACK，这允许接收端告知发送端哪些包已经收到，从而仅重传未被确认接收的数据包，减少不必要的重传。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"无连接操作"}],"： 基于 UDP 的实现使得 KCP 在传输数据前不需要像 TCP 那样进行三次握手建立连接，这减少了初始的延迟，并使其能在连接性较差的网络环境下更加灵活和快速。"]}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c","\n","$L5d","\n","$L5e","\n","$L5f","\n","$L60","\n","$L61","\n","$L62","\n","$L63","\n","$L64","\n","$L65","\n","$L66","\n","$L67","\n","$L68","\n","$L69","\n","$L6a","\n","$L6b","\n","$L6c","\n","$L6d","\n","$L6e","\n","$L6f","\n","$L70","\n","$L71","\n","$L72","\n","$L73","\n","$L74","\n","$L75","\n","$L76","\n","$L77","\n","$L78","\n","$L79","\n","$L7a","\n","$L7b","\n","$L7c","\n","$L7d","\n","$L7e","\n","$L7f","\n","$L80","\n","$L81","\n","$L82","\n","$L83","\n","$L84","\n","$L85","\n","$L86","\n","$L87","\n","$L88","\n","$L89","\n","$L8a","\n","$L8b","\n","$L8c","\n","$L8d","\n","$L8e","\n","$L8f","\n","$L90","\n","$L91","\n","$L92","\n","$L93","\n","$L94","\n","$L95","\n","$L96","\n","$L97","\n","$L98","\n","$L99","\n","$L9a","\n","$L9b","\n","$L9c","\n","$L9d","\n","$L9e","\n","$L9f","\n","$La0","\n","$La1","\n","$La2","\n","$La3","\n","$La4","\n","$La5","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$La6","\n","$La7","\n","$La8","\n","$La9","\n","$Laa","\n","$Lab","\n","$Lac","\n","$Lad","\n","$Lae","\n","$Laf","\n","$Lb0","\n","$Lb1","\n","$Lb2","\n","$Lb3","\n","$Lb4","\n","$Lb5","\n","$Lb6","\n","$Lb7","\n","$Lb8","\n","$Lb9","\n","$Lba","\n","$Lbb","\n","$Lbc","\n","$Lbd","\n","$Lbe","\n","$Lbf","\n","$Lc0","\n","$Lc1","\n","$Lc2","\n","$Lc3","\n","$Lc4","\n","$Lc5","\n","$Lc6","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$Lc7","\n","$Lc8","\n","$Lc9","\n","$Lca","\n","$Lcb","\n","$Lcc","\n","$Lcd","\n","$Lce","\n","$Lcf","\n","$Ld0","\n","$Ld1","\n","$Ld2","\n","$Ld3","\n","$Ld4","\n","$Ld5","\n","$Ld6","\n","$Ld7","\n","$Ld8","\n","$Ld9","\n","$Lda","\n","$Ldb","