70:["$","ol","ol-2",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["每收到一个数据报文, 都会根据它的编号将它插入到 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"rcv_buf"}]," 对应的位置中；"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["接着检查 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"rcv_nxt"}]," 能否向右移动, 只有当报文的顺序正确且连续才能移动；"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["在上图的例子中由于 4 号报文的缺失, ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"rcv_nxt"}]," 只能处于 4 号位置等待，5, 6 号报文也不能移动到 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"rcv_queue"}]," 中；"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["等到 4 号报文到达后，才能将 4, 5, 6 号报文一并移动到 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"rcv_queue"}]," 中，同时 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"rcv_nxt"}]," 会右移到 7 号位置。"]}],"\n"]}]
