74:["$","p","p-59",{"children":"① t1 时刻发送方发送 1 号报文, 1 号报文放入发送缓冲区中, snd_una 指向 1, snd_nxt 指向 2."}]
75:["$","p","p-60",{"children":"② t2 至 t3 时刻发送方依次发送 2 至 3 号报文, snd_nxt 依次后移."}]
76:["$","p","p-61",{"children":"③ 1 号报文丢包."}]
77:["$","p","p-62",{"children":"④ t4, t5 时刻接收方收到 3 号和 2 号报文, 放入 rcv_buf 中; 随后回复 3 号和 2 号 ACK. 此时由于 1 号报文缺失, rcv_nxt 始终指向 1."}]
78:["$","p","p-63",{"children":"⑤ 3 号 ACK 丢包."}]
79:["$","p","p-64",{"children":"⑥ t7 时刻发送方收到 2 号 ACK, 将 2 号报文标记为已送达. 此时由于 3 号 ACK 丢包, 3 号报文未标记为已送达. 由于 1 号报文未确认送达, snd_una 亦指向 1."}]
7a:["$","p","p-65",{"children":"⑦ t8 时刻 1 号报文超时, 重传."}]
7b:["$","p","p-66",{"children":"⑧ t9 时刻接收方收到 1 号报文, 放入 rcv_buf 中; 这时 1, 2, 3 号报文顺序正确, rcv_nxt 右移到 4 号位置. 接收方回复 1 号 ACK, 同时带上 una = 4."}]
7c:["$","p","p-67",{"children":"⑨ t10 时刻发送方收到 1 号 ACK, 将 1 号报文标记为已送达. 同时 una 表明 1, 2, 3 号报文均已送达, 因此也将 3 号报文标记为已送达. snd_una 移动到 4."}]
7d:["$","h3","h3-10",{"id":"3-超时重传","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#3-超时重传","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#3-超时重传"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. 超时重传","position":{"start":{"line":514,"column":5,"offset":17298},"end":{"line":514,"column":12,"offset":17305}}}]},"children":"3. 超时重传"}]}]
7e:["$","p","p-68",{"children":["超时重传是当发送的数据包在预定时间内未被确认时，重新发送该数据包的机制。在 KCP 中，这个时间由重新传输超时（RTO）决定。KCP 计算 RTO 初始值的方法是 TCP 的标准方法, 规定在 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6298.html","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6298.html"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"RFC 6298","position":{"start":{"line":516,"column":99,"offset":17405},"end":{"line":516,"column":107,"offset":17413}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":516,"column":98,"offset":17404},"end":{"line":516,"column":153,"offset":17459}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"RFC 6298"}]," 中。"]}]
7f:["$","p","p-69",{"children":"这里还是贴出源码讲比较直观："}]
80:["$","pre","pre-4",{"data-language":"C","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-c","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"static"}]," ",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"void"}]," ",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-title function_","children":"ikcp_update_ack"}],["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-params","children":"(ikcpcb *kcp, IINT32 rtt)"}],"\n{\n\tIINT32 rto = ",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"0"}],";\n\t",["$","span","span-5",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"if"}]," (kcp->rx_srtt == ",["$","span","span-6",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"0"}],") {\n\t\tkcp->rx_srtt = rtt;\n\t\tkcp->rx_rttval = rtt / ",["$","span","span-7",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"2"}],";\n\t}\t",["$","span","span-8",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"else"}]," {\n\t\t",["$","span","span-9",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"long"}]," delta = rtt - kcp->rx_srtt;\n\t\t",["$","span","span-10",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"if"}]," (delta < ",["$","span","span-11",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"0"}],") delta = -delta;\n\t\tkcp->rx_rttval = (",["$","span","span-12",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"3"}]," * kcp->rx_rttval + delta) / ",["$","span","span-13",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"4"}],";\n\t\tkcp->rx_srtt = (",["$","span","span-14",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"7"}]," * kcp->rx_srtt + rtt) / ",["$","span","span-15",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"8"}],";\n\t\t",["$","span","span-16",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"if"}]," (kcp->rx_srtt < ",["$","span","span-17",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"1"}],") kcp->rx_srtt = ",["$","span","span-18",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"1"}],";\n\t}\n\trto = kcp->rx_srtt + _imax_(kcp->interval, ",["$","span","span-19",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"4"}]," * kcp->rx_rttval);\n\tkcp->rx_rto = _ibound_(kcp->rx_minrto, rto, IKCP_RTO_MAX);\n}\n"]}]}]
81:["$","p","p-70",{"children":"这个计算过程笔者就不做详细介绍了，代码里面的公式读者可以尝试自行画图进行理解，这里就不花大篇幅画公式了，下面我尝试以更通俗易懂的话语解释 RTO，只需要理解它在做什么，为什么这么做，就可以了，个人觉得对公式的细节可以暂且忽略。"}]
82:["$","h4","h4-13",{"id":"31-rto-计算目的","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#31-rto-计算目的","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#31-rto-计算目的"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.1 RTO 计算目的","position":{"start":{"line":541,"column":6,"offset":18108},"end":{"line":541,"column":18,"offset":18120}}}]},"children":"3.1 RTO 计算目的"}]}]
83:["$","p","p-71",{"children":"KCP 的 RTO 计算是为了确定在多长时间内未收到确认（ACK）时，应该重新发送数据包。这段时间被称为重传超时时间（RTO）。计算 RTO 的目的是在网络条件变化的情况下，既能快速响应数据丢失，也能避免不必要的重传，从而保持高效的传输。"}]
84:["$","h4","h4-14",{"id":"32-rto-计算涉及的变量解释","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#32-rto-计算涉及的变量解释","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#32-rto-计算涉及的变量解释"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.2 RTO 计算涉及的变量解释","position":{"start":{"line":545,"column":6,"offset":18248},"end":{"line":545,"column":23,"offset":18265}}}]},"children":"3.2 RTO 计算涉及的变量解释"}]}]
85:["$","p","p-72",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"RTT 和 SRTT 的概念:"}]}]
86:["$","ul","ul-22",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"RTT（Round-Trip Time）: 是从发送一个数据包到收到其确认（ACK）所花的时间。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"SRTT（Smoothed RTT）: 是 RTT 的加权平均值，它代表了 RTT 的一个更稳定的估计值。SRTT 的目的是减少 RTT 的短期波动对 RTO 的影响。"}],"\n"]}]
87:["$","p","p-73",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"RTT 变化值（RTT variance）"}],"：网络传输时间并不总是固定的，有时会因为网络拥塞或其他原因出现波动。我们通过计算 RTT 变化值（RTT variance）来估计这种波动的大小。"]}]
88:["$","p","p-74",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"为什么需要 SRTT 和 RTT 变化值："}]}]
89:["$","ul","ul-23",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"SRTT 给我们一个平均的 RTT 估计值。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"RTT 变化值告诉我们网络的波动性。如果波动很大，我们希望 RTO 更大，以免因为短暂的网络延迟就触发不必要的重传。"}],"\n"]}]
8a:["$","h4","h4-15",{"id":"33-rto-计算步骤","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#33-rto-计算步骤","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#33-rto-计算步骤"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.3 RTO 计算步骤","position":{"start":{"line":559,"column":6,"offset":18646},"end":{"line":559,"column":18,"offset":18658}}}]},"children":"3.3 RTO 计算步骤"}]}]
8b:["$","p","p-75",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"1. 初始化"}],"：初次计算时，我们没有历史 RTT 值，所以直接用第一次测量的 RTT 来初始化 SRTT，并将 RTT 变化值设为 RTT 的一半。"]}]
8c:["$","p","p-76",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"2. 更新 SRTT 和 RTT 变化值"}],":"]}]
8d:["$","ul","ul-24",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"每次我们测量新的 RTT，就用它来更新 SRTT 和 RTT 变化值。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"更新 SRTT：我们不直接替换旧的 SRTT，而是用一个平滑的方式（即加权平均），使得 SRTT 逐渐靠近新 RTT，但又不会剧烈变化。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"更新 RTT 变化值：计算新的 RTT 与 SRTT 的差值，用这个差值来更新 RTT 变化值，使其反映当前网络波动的大小。"}],"\n"]}]
8e:["$","p","p-77",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"3. 计算 RTO"}],":"]}]
8f:["$","ul","ul-25",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"用 SRTT 加上四倍的 RTT 变化值来计算 RTO，这样可以确保 RTO 足够长，能涵盖大部分的网络波动。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["我们还要确保 RTO 不小于一个最小值（",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"rx_minrto"}],"），以防止 RTO 过小导致频繁重传；也不能大于一个最大值（",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"IKCP_RTO_MAX"}],"），以防止 RTO 过大影响响应速度。"]}],"\n"]}]
